{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はママとお買い物してきたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼購入品／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑毛糸とかレースとかいろいろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、パナマボーイで\nコーデュロイのロンスカ2着"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも裏原とかでかわいいお店\nいっぱい見てきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい雑貨屋さんと見つけちゃった\n楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか最近緑色がすきで、\n服を見ても何を見ても\n緑色に私の緑センサーが反応する"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑の服が増えちゃうよーきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スープカレー食べたあとに\nフローズンヨーグルト食べたっ\nさっぱりさわやかおいしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性じゃないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手足冷たくて辛い><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公園で一番好きな遊具は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャングルジム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今マンモスフリーマーケット\n行くか悩んでます\nいったほうがいいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと盛り上がると思うので\n来てほしいなあ...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モード系とワイルド系\nどっちの服装が好きですか⁉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モード系"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニスカートとロングスカート\nどっちが好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロング！でも、乃木坂の衣装\nみたいに中途半端な丈もすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手した時の気持ちは\nどう思ったかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのとき、\n握手しにきてくれるって言うのが\n新鮮で、不思議な気持ちだった！\n終わったあと、すごい反省した。\n「あんな感じで良かったのかな？」\nって。ぎこちなかっただろうな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あの時思った気持ちは\n大切にしたいです。\n実は握手会する前にみんなで\n練習してたんだよー笑！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校で憧れの先輩とかいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学校も今も、\n部活とか入ってないから\n先輩と絡まないしいないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントおそくなっちゃうけど\nみてくれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでます^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"修学旅行で京都奈良に来てるけど、\nまりかは修学旅行どこだった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も中学は京都奈良でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"団子潰し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日も頑張りまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}